// The process and its environment (M6 Task 10).
//
// `exit(code)`, `getenv(name)`, and `getcwd()` are builtins, in scope in every
// file. This module adds the statement-shaped exit a report wants and documents
// the environment and directory spellings beside it.
//
// `getcwd()` answers the current working directory as
// `Result[string, io.Error]`. It is UTF-8 on every target, including Windows,
// and a failure is an `io.Error` value rather than the empty string -- matching
// `read_file` and `getenv`.
//
// Ownership: `exit_with` never returns and owns nothing. `getcwd()`'s string is
// owned by the caller and released like any other string.
